        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Based on ASTRA 21001, Fachhandbuch Trassee/Umwelt (FHB T/U), Lärmschutzwand Freifeld, Betonrippenplatte (ASTRA). Dimensions based on scaled measurement using known reference values.\n\n# Included processes\n1 meter of noise barrier wall installed along the roadside in open terrain.\nTotal visible height: 3.2 meters, consisting of a ribbed concrete panel with a height of 3.0 meters. Service life 80 years.\nThe system boundary includes production (A1–A3) and construction / transport (A4–A5) stages for one meter of installed noise barrier wall, including excavation, backfilling, and foundation works.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
